<div class="home-office-testimonials">
    <div class="page-width">
        <div class="testimonials-wrap">
            <div class="testimonial-left">
                <div class="testimonail-text">
                    <h2 class="heading">Real Offices. <br>Real Inspiration.</h2>
                    <p>See how thousands of remote workers are transforming their corners into productivity powerhouses. From cozy nooks to dedicated executive suites, find the look that matches your vibe.</p>
                    <a href="/pages/inspired" class="button button-primary btn-round">
                        GET INSPIRED
                    </a>

                    <div class="verified-reviews-wrap">
                        <img src="{{ 'reviewers.png' | file_img_url: '172x' }}" alt="verified reviews from real home offices" width="172" height="auto"> 1,000+ verified reviews from real home offices
                    </div>
                </div>
            </div>
            <div class="testimonial-right">
                <div class="review-img-wrap">
                    <div class="left-wrap">
                        <picture>
                             <source srcset="{{ 'inspiration-review-1.png' | file_img_url: '740x' }} 2x" media="(min-width: 769px) and (min-resolution: 2dppx)">
                            <img src="{{ 'inspiration-review-1.png' | file_img_url : '370x'}}" alt="Real Offices Real Inspiration" width="370" height="404">
                        </picture>
                        <picture>
                            <source srcset="{{ 'inspiration-review-2.png' | file_img_url: '740x' }} 2x" media="(min-width: 769px) and (min-resolution: 2dppx)">
                            <img src="{{ 'inspiration-review-2.png' | file_img_url : '370x'}}" alt="Real Offices Real Inspiration" width="370" height="404">
                        </picture>
                    </div>
                    <div class="right-wrap">
                        <picture>
                            <source srcset="{{ 'inspiration-review-3.png' | file_img_url: '740x' }} 2x" media="(min-width: 769px) and (min-resolution: 2dppx)">
                            <img src="{{ 'inspiration-review-3.png' | file_img_url : '370x'}}" alt="Real Offices Real Inspiration" width="370" height="404">
                        </picture>
                        <div class="card">
                            <div class="stars">
                                {% for i in (1..5) %}
                                    {{ star }}
                                {% endfor %}
                            </div>
                            <h3 class="card-title">Still the best chair option after 15 years</h3>
                            <p>I've had a Gregory chair at work for the last 15 years and found it the most comfortable for my body shape. During the Covid lockdown I needed to find a work chair for home and was so happy to be able to find it at Gregory.</p>
                            <p class="reviewer">- Christina Cassidy</p>
                        </div>
                        <div class="last-card-wrap">
                            <div class="card lastcard">
                                <div class="stars">
                                    {% for i in (1..5) %}
                                        {{ star }}
                                    {% endfor %}
                                </div>
                            </div>
                            <a href="/pages/reviews" class="link">READ REVIEWS</a>
                        </div>
                    </div>
                </div>
            </div>
        </div>
    </div>
</div>

{% schema %}
{
"name": "Home office testimonials",
"settings": []
}
{% endschema %}
